From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:25:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): port end4-pC's Bar page

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: modules/ii/settings/pages/BarConfig.qml
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: the ii settings app has no Bar configuration page; the fork has one but
targets features and a bar.layouts system the pin does not have.
Port: hand-ported (fork-only bar layout/frame/Dynamic Island/divider/media/wallpaper-toggle/
indicator-style controls dropped, see docs/II-INTEGRATION.md; Bar style trimmed to the pin's
3 cornerStyle values; Group style rewritten from fork strings to the pin's bar.borderless bool;
tooltips guard dropped to match pin defaults); pin controls with no fork equivalent carried over
Drop when: upstream ships equivalent pages, or the settings port is abandoned.
---
